From 83e21e7ec79a7ebbba51e35b8304f22d32272e85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scada <scada@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 19:34:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/78] arm64: configs: joan_defconfig: all netfilter/tc
 options netd uses

netd's BandwidthController needs xt_policy (and friends); without it netd
exits, and netd's onrestart restarts zygote, so the framework never
comes up. Enable every xt match/target and tc qdisc/classifier/action
gki_defconfig has.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0144VMKxYe33NKa3LLPZNivr
---
